 The Notes public API is read-only in this release. It returns permission-shaped non-secure notes using the API key creator's workspace context. Secure notes are not exposed through the public API, and note writes, revisions, collection management, and linked-record mutations remain browser/internal workflows.
 
+### Adoption Sample
+
+- `GET /api/v1/adoption-sample` requires `adoption_sample:read`
+- `GET /api/v1/adoption-sample/:id` requires `adoption_sample:read`
+
+The Adoption Sample public API is the generated read-only module scaffold. It returns the workspace's records through the shared public envelope and pager, and the scaffold returns none until module-owned storage exists.
+
